{"title": "Vengeful Father (passive feature)", "pageid": 45613, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vengeful_Father_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Legendary actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rage_Bear_Heart.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Rage_Bear_Heart.webp/300px-Rage_Bear_Heart.webp, /w/images/0/06/Rage_Bear_Heart.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Rage_Bear_Heart.webp/300px-Rage_Bear_Heart.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Rage_Bear_Heart.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Vengeful Father</b> is a passive feature available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Mate\" title=\"Owlbear Mate\">Owlbear Mate</a> summoned by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Call_Consort\" title=\"Call Consort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Call Consort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Legendary_Action_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Call_Consort\" title=\"Call Consort\">Call Consort</a> in Honour mode.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>At low health or the death of a family member, this Owlbear becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear%27s_Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Owlbear's Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enraged\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Owlbear%27s_Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear%27s_Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Owlbear's Rage (Condition)\">Enraged</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Owlbear_Mate\" title=\"Owlbear Mate\">Owlbear Mate</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715071246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 926/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5600/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2582/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643729/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.060      1 -total\n 99.00%   34.709      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 44.18%   15.490      1 Template:PageSeo\n 43.30%   15.182      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.73%   10.423      2 Template:Icon_link\n 28.60%   10.028      2 Template:Icon_text\n 27.03%    9.477      1 Template:SAI\n 24.60%    8.624      4 Template:Trim\n 19.86%    6.963      2 Template:Ifempty\n 19.39%    6.797      1 Template:Cond\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:45613-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715071246 and revision id 228540. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}